    "sections": {
        "description": "The Lawyer Consultant theme is a modern, professional, and responsive solution crafted for legal professionals, law firms, attorneys, advocates, legal advisors, corporate lawyers, criminal lawyers, family lawyers, business consultants, legal consultants, law offices, legal experts, and solo practitioners seeking a sophisticated online presence. Designed to showcase practice areas, legal services, case studies, and client testimonials, the theme also supports appointment booking, consultation scheduling, and inquiry forms through the Contact Form 7 plugin. Its mobile-friendly and retina-ready design ensures a flawless user experience across desktops, tablets, and smartphones, while fast loading speed, SEO-friendly code, and clean architecture enhance search visibility. With features like blog sections for legal insights, call-to-action buttons, team member showcases, and customizable banners, the Lawyer Consultant theme provides a secure, elegant, and highly functional platform for building trust and attracting clients."
    },
